{"asset_key":"ep6/gameplay_story_16601170","episode":"ep6","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"16601170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1660117001:0":{"text":"와일더스 친구들, 아쿠보르에 대해 알고 있어요?","source_cn":"来自绿裔的朋友，你们知道雅库伯尔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5698F118FC12936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1660117002:0":{"text":"네. 다프니 할머니께서 말씀하신 적이 있어요. 만 년 전에 아쿠보르 부족이라는 원시 루나애니가 먼 길을 건너서 땅거미 숲에 정착했다고요...","source_cn":"嗯，我曾听达赫妮贤者提起过。万年以前，有一群原始兽人不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38CD8357DA280D62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1660117003:1":{"text":"그 사람들이 지금 와일더스들의 선조겠죠.","source_cn":"那些人应该就是如今一部分绿裔的先祖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34EB44999C45166A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1660117004:0":{"text":"잠깐... 선조라고요?","source_cn":"等等……先祖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601841B16FF6B6FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660117005:1":{"text":"맞아요, 맞아요! 저희 트라이브와 와일더스는 뿌리가 같을지도 몰라요!","source_cn":"没错没错！我们蛮血和你们绿裔，可能有着共同的先祖哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x968E4EFA588AF369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1660117006:1":{"text":"그래서 가끔 막연히 언젠가 와일더스와 친구가 될 수 있을 것 같다는 생각이 들었나 봐요. 역시 착각이 아니었네요! 어쩌면 선조들이 정말 함께 살았고, 아주 친한 친구였을지도 모르잖아요!","source_cn":"难怪有时我隐隐会觉得，说不定哪天能和绿裔成为朋友，看来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D0B004DE6002AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1660117007:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 직접 겪지 않았다면, 나도 이게 사실이라고 믿기 어려웠을 거야.","source_cn":"若非<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x702D10C787727979","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 직접 겪지 않았다면, 나도 이게 사실이라고 믿기 어려웠을 거야.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 직접 겪지 않았다면, 나도 이게 사실이라고 믿기 어려웠을 거야.","variant_male_record_index":"218401","variant_female_record_index":"218402","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1660117008:1":{"text":"아, 맞아요! 항상 말해주고 싶었는데요... 당신 귀 정말 귀여워요!","source_cn":"哦，对！我一直想说，你的长耳朵好可爱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA5E1180EB2E60A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1660117009:1":{"text":"아... 고마워요. 당신 꼬리도 정말 예쁘네요.","source_cn":"啊……谢谢你的夸奖，你的尾巴也很漂亮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x305BF54AC658F322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1660117010:0":{"text":"참 흥미로운 역사군. 하지만 난 너무 늦게 어두운 지하에서 태어나서 말이지. 얼마나 많은 재미있는 일을 놓쳤을지 상상도 못 하겠군.","source_cn":"真是有趣的历史。可惜我出生得太晚，还生在昏暗的地下，都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCAD28DB9269DC39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1660117011:1":{"text":"봐, 역사는 내가 들고 있는 이 카드 같아. 겉보기엔 무늬가 제각각이지만, 섞고 섞어 뒤집어 보면 같은 카드일지도 모르지.","source_cn":"看吧，历史就像我手里的这副牌，看似花色各异，洗来洗去，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF30309327F25CA99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1660117012:0":{"text":"이상한 비유입니다.","source_cn":"这个比喻很奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528F0E071211F3FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1660117013:1":{"text":"그보다 선조들의 이야기가 궁금하군요. 자세히 들려주실 수 있겠습니까?","source_cn":"比起这些，我更想知道我们先祖的故事。详细一点的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5F6296A3389527B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1660117014:1":{"text":"하아, 정말 따분한 녀석이라니까.","source_cn":"唉，多么无趣的人啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C178CCF4E451490","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1660117015:0":{"text":"괜찮아요, 아무리 긴 이야기라도 다시 들려드릴 수 있답니다!","source_cn":"没关系，我很乐意再讲述一遍这